# Definite integral of t^n from 1 to x (x > 0): (x^(n+1) - 1)/(n+1), or ln x when n = -1.
# Source: A. I. Kitov, N. A. Krinitsky, Elektronnye tsifrovye mashiny i programmirovanie (Electronic Digital Machines and Programming), 1959, docs/ecm_i_prog.pdf, section 31 example 1, printed pp. 155-156 (concrete listing p. 156).
