# 0021-0022 branch on n = -1; 0023-0032 first branch; 0033 second branch; 0034-0036 common end.
# 0042-0043 are working cells; the answer is in 0044, converted to decimal and punched.
# 0004 is the book's input card: read 22 (octal) words into 0020.
START 0020
